(   1. Positional-Only \(`/` marker\):) Tj
T*
(   - Arguments preceding `/` CANNOT be passed as keyword arguments. `func\(pos_only_1=10\)` raises a) Tj
T*
(   `TypeError`.) Tj
T*
(   - Purpose: Enables C-extension compatibility, allows changing parameter names in future library) Tj
T*
(   versions without breaking callers, and improves performance.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Keyword-Only \(`*` marker\):) Tj
T*
(   - Arguments following `*` MUST be passed by keyword name: `func\(..., kw_only_1=True\)`.) Tj
T*
(   - Purpose: Eliminates cryptic boolean flags in call sites \(e.g., `set_led\(True, False, True\)`) Tj
T*
(   vs `set_led\(red=True, green=False, blink=True\)`\), dramatically improving code clarity in) Tj
T*
(   embedded APIs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
