T*
(   Stack Unwinding during Exceptions:) Tj
T*
(   1. When an exception is raised \(`raise ValueError`\), the runtime checks the current frame's) Tj
T*
(   exception handling table \(block stack\).) Tj
T*
(   2. If no matching `except` block is found, the current frame is popped from the call stack, its) Tj
T*
(   local variables are dereferenced, and control unwinds to the caller frame \(`f_back`\).) Tj
T*
(   3. This process continues up the call stack until a matching handler is found or the top-level) Tj
T*
(   module is reached, whereupon CPython prints the full Traceback and exits.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
