(   [Problem Statement]: Detail Nested Functions and Factory Functions, writing a Configurable Digital Low-Pass Filter Factory in Python.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Factory functions return customized function closures based on configuration parameters:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Discrete First-Order Low-Pass Filter \(LPF\) Factory:) Tj
T*
(   Difference equation: $y[n] = \\alpha x[n] + \(1 - \\alpha\) y[n-1]$, where $\\alpha = \\frac{\\Delta) Tj
T*
(   t}{\\tau + \\Delta t}$.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   ```python) Tj
T*
(   def make_low_pass_filter\(alpha\):) Tj
T*
(   """Factory returning a stateful discrete low-pass filter closure.""") Tj
T*
(   prev_y = 0.0 # Persistent state across calls) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   def filter_sample\(x\):) Tj
T*
(   nonlocal prev_y) Tj
T*
(   y = alpha * x + \(1.0 - alpha\) * prev_y) Tj
T*
(   prev_y = y) Tj
T*
(   return y) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   return filter_sample) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Instantiate filter with smoothing factor alpha = 0.2) Tj
T*
(   lpf = make_low_pass_filter\(0.2\)) Tj
T*
(   noisy_signal = [0.0, 10.0, 10.0, 10.0, 10.0, 0.0]) Tj
T*
(   filtered = [round\(lpf\(sample\), 2\) for sample in noisy_signal]) Tj
T*
(   print\('Filtered Output:', filtered\)) Tj
T*
(   # Outputs: [0.0, 2.0, 3.6, 4.88, 5.9, 4.72] \(smooth exponential ramp\)) Tj
T*
(   ```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
