(   The Tower of Hanoi recursive algorithm:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   ```python) Tj
T*
(   def tower_of_hanoi\(n, source, target, auxiliary\):) Tj
T*
(   if n == 1:) Tj
T*
(   print\(f'Move disk 1 from rod {source} to rod {target}'\)) Tj
T*
(   return 1) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   moves = 0) Tj
T*
(   # 1. Move top n-1 disks from source to auxiliary) Tj
T*
(   moves += tower_of_hanoi\(n - 1, source, auxiliary, target\)) Tj
T*
(   # 2. Move n-th disk from source to target) Tj
T*
(   print\(f'Move disk {n} from rod {source} to rod {target}'\)) Tj
T*
(   moves += 1) Tj
T*
(   # 3. Move n-1 disks from auxiliary to target) Tj
T*
(   moves += tower_of_hanoi\(n - 1, auxiliary, target, source\)) Tj
T*
(   return moves) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   total_moves = tower_of_hanoi\(3, 'A', 'C', 'B'\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(f'Total Moves Required: {total_moves}'\) # 2^3 - 1 = 7 moves) Tj
T*
(   ```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Mathematical Complexity: Recurrence relation $T\(n\) = 2T\(n-1\) + 1 = 2^n - 1$. Time complexity is) Tj
T*
(   $O\(2^n\)$, and space complexity on call stack is $O\(n\)$.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
